## ⚙️ Même chose pour le mois

```php
public function handle()
{
    $month = now()->subMonth();
    $total = DB::table('paiements')
        ->whereMonth('date_paiement', $month->month)
        ->whereYear('date_paiement', $month->year)
        ->sum('montant');

    DB::table('archive_paiement_mois')->insert([
        'mois' => $month->month,
        'annee' => $month->year,
        'total_paiement' => $total,
        'created_at' => now(),
    ]);
}
```

Programmé via :

```php
$schedule->command('paiements:archiver-mois')->monthlyOn(1, '03:00');
```

